amai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2020710/extras/35801e60bfb31fd774defbd0654a2a15.poster.avif?t=1771527614\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2020710/extras/35801e60bfb31fd774defbd0654a2a15.webm?t=1771527614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2020710/extras/35801e60bfb31fd774defbd0654a2a15.mp4?t=1771527614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome new survivors \u2013 manage tasks and production to keep everyone happy and healthy. More settlers means more needs to be met, but don't worry. You'll teach your new pals how to work, and they'll help you automate the tasks you like less.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2020710/extras/dc1092ec41be0f2622070860c2ffa53a.avif?t=1771527614\" width=600 height=150 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2020710/extras/cd90e59295bbeac68b262f42cd280e70.poster.avif?t=1771527614\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2020710/extras/cd90e59295bbeac68b262f42cd280e70.webm?t=1771527614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2020710/extras/cd90e59295bbeac68b262f42cd280e70.mp4?t=1771527614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master mad science \u2013 push past the limits of modern engineering and common sense. From basic devices like water distiller or coffee maker to robots that help you further automate your work, power plants, submarine, and even\u2026 a rocket. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2020710/extras/f3452e336fe593e750ecf1bc0c563ace.avif?t=1771527614\" width=600 height=150 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2020710/extras/2646df11db7c76a8d1eee4c4346a3433.poster.avif?t=1771527614\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2020710/extras/2646df11db7c76a8d1eee4c4346a3433.webm?t=1771527614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2020710/extras/2646df11db7c76a8d1eee4c4346a3433.mp4?t=1771527614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build boats and discover islands looming on the horizon.  Jump into your submarine to explore the depths of the ocean, look for ores and oil, or build an underwater farm.</p>","developers":["YYZ Studio"],"dlc":[4156780],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2020710/7236297d57d5bcd8aec47450661b912dcb3de8ce/header.jpg?t=1771527614","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a9 2025 YYZ Studio. Published by Pretty Soon. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2020710/2012298658/2270f1808b8d8210bf547cff88c1440df80